id: mecha-mimicry
name: Mecha Mimicry
# A Racial Factor: what it asks for, shown beside its Factor Traits and never enforced (the user's). Its Factor Trait: Robot Ripoff 1.
requirement: >
  Robot
maximumFactor: 1
prerequisites: N/A
description: >
  You were created in the image of another being. Whether that’s to act as a sparring partner, or to hunt down and kill that being, your creator gave you a semblance of their likeness.
